sequenceDiagram
    actor Listener
    participant UI
    participant API
    participant Guard as Upload Guard
    participant Signal as Signal Analyzer
    participant Model as Catalog KNN Model
    participant Draft as Memory Drafts
    participant DB as SQLite Private Catalog

    Listener->>UI: Select permitted audio and confirm rights
    UI->>API: Multipart audio upload
    API->>Guard: Stream with size and signature limits
    alt Invalid, corrupt, silent, too short, or too long
        Guard-->>API: Safe validation error
        API->>Guard: Delete temporary file
        API-->>UI: Actionable error
    else Valid audio
        Guard->>Signal: Randomized temporary path
        Signal->>Signal: Measure duration and tempo
        Signal->>Signal: Estimate numeric sound features
        Signal->>Model: Classify supported genre and mood
        Model-->>Signal: Labels and confidence
        Signal-->>API: Values, provenance, and warnings
        API->>Guard: Delete temporary file
        API->>Draft: Store audio-free proposal by session
        API-->>UI: Editable review proposal
        alt Listener discards
            UI->>API: Cancel draft
            API->>Draft: Delete proposal
        else Listener corrects and approves
            UI->>API: Submit reviewed values
            API->>DB: Save values and correction provenance
            API->>Draft: Delete proposal
            DB-->>UI: Song available for recommendations
        end
    end
